{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":10,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":394,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1905338,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":284917,"Name":"Jellym","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284917.jpg?_r=1444797756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1443115753,"LastPoster":{"Id":284917,"Name":"Jellym","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284917.jpg?_r=1444797756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":23,"Preview":{"Id":1905338,"PostDate":1443115753,"PostContent":"Hello ladies! I got engaged in Jan 2015 and we are planning to host our wedding in Jamaica! We ar...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jalisa_675@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"97.106.77.85","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1443115532,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284917.jpg?_r=1444797756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Jellym","Id":284917,"Name":"Jellym","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.106.77.85","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d4ebaef9e5d3d5c71c3e772a164f0f6","RawContent":"Hello ladies! I got engaged in Jan 2015 and we are planning to host our wedding in Jamaica! We aren&#039;t set on a date as yet but are thinking early 2017. I need help in finding a location! Somewhere in the Negril or Montego Bay Area. Nice, reasonably priced venues! Our budget is 12-16K. Any suggestions?","Attachments":[],"Id":1905338,"PostDate":1443115753,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hello ladies! I got engaged in Jan 2015 and we are planning to host our wedding in Jamaica! We aren't set on a date as yet but are thinking early 2017. I need help in finding a location! Somewhere in the Negril or Montego Bay Area. Nice, reasonably priced venues! Our budget is 12-16K. Any suggestions? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jalisa_675@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"97.106.77.85","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1443115532,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284917.jpg?_r=1444797756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Jellym","Id":284917,"Name":"Jellym","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.228.47.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f27c020ebb8529830179e9d1b819737a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Jellym\" post=\"1905338\" timestamp=\"1443112153\"]\nHello ladies! I got engaged in Jan 2015 and we are planning to host our wedding in Jamaica! We aren&#039;t set on a date as yet but are thinking early 2017. I need help in finding a location! Somewhere in the Negril or Montego Bay Area. Nice, reasonably priced venues! Our budget is 12-16K. Any suggestions?[\/quote]Congrats on your engagement. Aw! I was also married in Negril, Jamaica and it has a special place in my heart. I got married at the Sandals Beaches but I&#039;m not sure that would work for you.\n\nI know lots of people like the Iberostar properties in Montego Bay. You can check that. Good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1905364,"PostDate":1443133918,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Jellym, on 24 September 2015 - 09:29 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello ladies! I got engaged in Jan 2015 and we are planning to host our wedding in Jamaica! We aren't set on a date as yet but are thinking early 2017. I need help in finding a location! Somewhere in the Negril or Montego Bay Area. Nice, reasonably priced venues! Our budget is 12-16K. Any suggestions?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Congrats on your engagement. Aw! I was also married in Negril, Jamaica and it has a special place in my heart. I got married at the Sandals Beaches but I'm not sure that would work for you.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know lots of people like the Iberostar properties in Montego Bay. You can check that. Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430537880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"1weddingirl","Id":282948,"Name":"1weddingirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.46.140","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f22525a9d28d1fc6bc812ed339c293a2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations! I was married in June in Montego Bay (my husband is also Jamaican). We ideally wanted to be in Negril, but a lot of the resorts there were adults-only and we had a few children to accommodate. We also had a lot of guests coming for just 4 nights, so being in Montego Bay with the proximity of the airport really allowed them maximize their vacation time. We were a little bummed to give up on Negril, but we absolutely loved Iberostar Rose Hall Suites.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How many people do you expect? Of course your budget makes a difference if you&#039;re talking 20 guests or 100 guests! Happy to answer any questions about the 3 Iberostar Rose Hall properties (they are add adjacent to each other, just different price points.)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905439,"PostDate":1443209534,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations! I was married in June in Montego Bay (my husband is also Jamaican). We ideally wanted to be in Negril, but a lot of the resorts there were adults-only and we had a few children to accommodate. We also had a lot of guests coming for just 4 nights, so being in Montego Bay with the proximity of the airport really allowed them maximize their vacation time. We were a little bummed to give up on Negril, but we absolutely loved Iberostar Rose Hall Suites.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How many people do you expect? Of course your budget makes a difference if you're talking 20 guests or 100 guests! Happy to answer any questions about the 3 Iberostar Rose Hall properties (they are add adjacent to each other, just different price points.)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403119687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"97.106.77.85","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5f8181f44cd3546ffa5b063337bc5551","RawContent":"We are going to send out 100 invites expecting maybe 85. I&#039;ve fallen in love with the humming bird hall because I like the fact that there isn&#039;t a requirement for a certain number of guests so we have some flexibility. \n[quote name=\"beckys98\" post=\"1905439\" timestamp=\"1443205934\"]\nCongratulations! I was married in June in Montego Bay (my husband is also Jamaican). We ideally wanted to be in Negril, but a lot of the resorts there were adults-only and we had a few children to accommodate. We also had a lot of guests coming for just 4 nights, so being in Montego Bay with the proximity of the airport really allowed them maximize their vacation time. We were a little bummed to give up on Negril, but we absolutely loved Iberostar Rose Hall Suites.\n \nHow many people do you expect? Of course your budget makes a difference if you&#039;re talking 20 guests or 100 guests! Happy to answer any questions about the 3 Iberostar Rose Hall properties (they are add adjacent to each other, just different price points.)[\/quote]Which three properties are included in the Iberostar Rose Hall properties?","Attachments":[],"Id":1905442,"PostDate":1443212348,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are going to send out 100 invites expecting maybe 85. I've fallen in love with the humming bird hall because I like the fact that there isn't a requirement for a certain number of guests so we have some flexibility. <br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>beckys98, on 25 September 2015 - 11:32 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Congratulations! I was married in June in Montego Bay (my husband is also Jamaican). We ideally wanted to be in Negril, but a lot of the resorts there were adults-only and we had a few children to accommodate. We also had a lot of guests coming for just 4 nights, so being in Montego Bay with the proximity of the airport really allowed them maximize their vacation time. We were a little bummed to give up on Negril, but we absolutely loved Iberostar Rose Hall Suites.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHow many people do you expect? Of course your budget makes a difference if you're talking 20 guests or 100 guests! Happy to answer any questions about the 3 Iberostar Rose Hall properties (they are add adjacent to each other, just different price points.)<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWhich three properties are included in the Iberostar Rose Hall properties? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jalisa_675@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"97.106.77.85","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1443115532,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284917.jpg?_r=1444797756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Jellym","Id":284917,"Name":"Jellym","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.110.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"551697ac57d3d4bc721e674c7f5c9be8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Jellym\"] Oh! So you&#039;re planning to do the wedding off-resort? I missed that when I read your question.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The Iberostars are called Iberostar Rose Hall Beach, Iberostar Rose Hall Suites, and Iberostar Rose Hall Grand.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905452,"PostDate":1443226905,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284917\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284917-jellym\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jellym<\/span><\/a> Oh! So you're planning to do the wedding off-resort? I missed that when I read your question.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The Iberostars are called Iberostar Rose Hall Beach, Iberostar Rose Hall Suites, and Iberostar Rose Hall Grand.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403119687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.112.169.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc8c16908a2fb181c83b21f2cafa1998","RawContent":"Yes. It will just work out better for us. I&#039;ve got some options so I&#039;m hopeful \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1905455,"PostDate":1443227691,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yes. It will just work out better for us. I've got some options so I'm hopeful <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jalisa_675@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"97.106.77.85","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1443115532,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284917.jpg?_r=1444797756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Jellym","Id":284917,"Name":"Jellym","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.231.40.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e8838c5cfca57927e933c6860092aa57","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Jellym\"] I&#039;m in the early stages as well and have been torn between resort sites and off resort sites. One off resort I found that is gorgeous is Rose Hall in Montego Bay. What other off-resort sites have you looked into?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1905958,"PostDate":1444090019,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"284917\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/284917-jellym\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jellym<\/span><\/a> I'm in the early stages as well and have been torn between resort sites and off resort sites. One off resort I found that is gorgeous is Rose Hall in Montego Bay. What other off-resort sites have you looked into?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427046004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1444096181","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":217,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.112.169.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df72d8c00473db9772548db2818daeea","RawContent":"I&#039;ve been looking into hummingbird hall. It&#039;s beautiful!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1905959,"PostDate":1444090813,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've been looking into hummingbird hall. It's beautiful!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jalisa_675@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"97.106.77.85","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1443115532,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284917.jpg?_r=1444797756","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Jellym","Id":284917,"Name":"Jellym","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.228.47.25","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79614,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84f10c3d70be1bbc4215667a4d09021b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Jellym\" post=\"1905959\" timestamp=\"1444087213\"]\nI&#039;ve been looking into hummingbird hall. It&#039;s beautiful!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]Congrats! Have you seen hummingbird hall or just online pics?","Attachments":[],"Id":1906075,"PostDate":1444360541,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Jellym, on 05 October 2015 - 04:20 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I've been looking into hummingbird hall. It's beautiful!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Congrats! Have you seen hummingbird hall or just online pics?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"theniylife@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.228.60.204","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1430537880,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.co