ut to one to see what kinds of services they offer. \n <p...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/63613-beach-palace-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1906167\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1444723584,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":122027,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that perianjay mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/63613-beach-palace-cancun-brides\/?view=findpost&p=1906108\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"greeneggsnsam\" Hi! Welcome to the forum. I'm getting married around the same time except this year.\n \nI'm not too sure how comparable the rates would be as i'm flying out of Toronto, Canada, but I do know that December is considered high season for travel so it's a bit more of a costly month to book.\n \nPalace resorts have a lot of perks if you book as a group. I'm not sure how that would work if you're all planning to book on your own, but there may be some risk in doing that with availability and having to ensure that your guests book before the resort is booked etc etc.\nI'm actually very glad we went with a travel agent as she was able to really organize the entire group and make sure everyone paid their final payment in time. We are now two months away and the resort is almost fully booked. My travel agent actually made an inquiry to add an additional room to my room block and they said the resort is booked up.\nIf you get an agent and they designate a room block those are guaranteed rooms for your guests and it will also count toward all of the group benefits that palace offers.\n \nIf you have any other questions, feel free to DM me! I'm two months away now <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"NotificationDate":1444389236,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":117344,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"greeneggsnsam,\n\nTammyWright has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Welcome greeneggsnsam to Best Destination Wedding\".\n\nTammyWright said:\n======================================================================\nHello greeneggsnsam,<br \/><br \/>Welcome to BestDestinationWedding.com (BDW). BDW is the Ultimate Resource for planning your destination wedding. We have over 70,000 registered bride, grooms and vendors.<br \/><br \/>Here are some links and tips that might make your time here on BDW more enjoyable.<br \/><br \/>If you have not done so, you may want to:<br \/>complete your profile (upload a photo, add profile details, etc.)<br \/>visit the Newbies forum and introduce yourself (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/f\/23\/newbies)<br \/>Start your own wedding planning blog (http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blogs\/)<br \/>find the forum for your wedding destination and create a subscription to threads\/members\/vendors that you are interested in<br \/><br \/>Here are some links that may be helpful to you:<br \/>Destin